{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1372,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50610dfbc1b0042b523bc2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，今天也来跑步吧。\r\n目的地就随心所欲啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17707cd2e6677d9515988736e54a20d5c74e4beb39f92c5717be46493756679c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b8f295bf19944684efa5f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做什么好呢？\r\n能让我听听你的意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed34014fb215ddbd41f41ad49c52c2e1cf13baaf245ba92cc79fdf73caae7364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d97b8c7f0dde7cce06a9e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想再稍微\r\n看着天空的颜色呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6369f779748c5b7285225955bb15dd7483395e68255aba9306abfd2f019371f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f3c4233386456381361bf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚动不了。\r\n……稍微等我一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24731de78b02470f0385aebe965cdc28aca91f0c92d56410d26d636f17ebe258",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1876a12edd6bde090dd7406c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想做的事情……\r\n我想想……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3464be5c4d1b27a75939ebc80acf718a3626d30835c6f75d87b5817bd47fc62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d862b186f53dccc836685ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，蹄铁磨损了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "21da175371fe521405200d8861fa188153e318d32f8497d07bd5c3628065fb6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8aaddab5f5b4fe4c71ce89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要参加竞赛？\r\n我不认为这是个好的决定就是了。\r\n真的要去吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "195d630e8cf7b1229d40c39e4e2aa4103cda66833225e1d4f73cba649143d00b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a9851f9d102855645adea63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不是很喜欢匆匆忙忙的呢。\r\n我还以为你知道我有自己的步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf400be97b22a92198a24945516442b2c2c783665ff5c23e083f2be84410fa73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1278e65d3a1b7b4d390d6b93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闸门就快要打开了……\r\n呵呵，真是兴奋……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ba84371b685ef26ed16f4c2922dbd5f0b845aafb9529f44abab8b7dd655d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2685d5c625f668f53b7f3a88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以清楚看见我想跑的方向。\r\n嗯，感觉今天会是很棒的一天呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e47a029ba7f5b3ef7df8b7a278fbb09850512389afc50a82fef34566132e3efb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1e696ef89d40e217637c0a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是为了在今天奔跑而诞生──\r\n能这样想的话，也挺不错的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "563d91eaa65f67a2acb7129c2e4bf79c42603e511305c12f3721090b41d784e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c7b6d008c9c9320f7b0cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有任何的禁忌，\r\n我会顺从自己的呼吸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ecdf4c2b6a22b8f66d07269a65399b94ba8de958dd330fa0047c4d16e2e968c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41395886ab29677ff9b6621a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想舍弃所有多余的东西，\r\n心无旁骛地奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "378bf41b09ba54c11d261f6645312ed0f8a7940e95389cb549c9cdefb4215516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59130f13ede69bd637148a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望能跑出一场足以让观众\r\n无法忘怀的精彩竞赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b935085542c2f65d8c80bd7c235a5b7fd54c4aa8e0015f3de67efb87cc375c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c30f2c39dc2236a166abd3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，\r\n感觉能跑出我的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6a561690a0ac129cd44ae4d40ac42114eb41969eac3250908eee02ac7f89de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0fa2de4dcb2e675a7c67d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的跑法\r\n只有今天才跑得出来。\r\n所以可别错过啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f1ce4789773e3cd6594ae2af1c98a5ad26b415d94f0fc4e56fbeef33c0ea9ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49acfcfecef1a328dd898fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想前往的地方\r\n只有我自己知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5993526736449bdb4276f6b8e8675c86e4f6e4a65abef63cbf9decaa89dbc09d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50602d1c8b5507769423b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………啊，抱歉。\r\n我在想事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c93103cd5622b52581360cd1dd0870b3da315e0170db6c85c0b28cb93387294a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d569988c58b0525a4439ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我现在到底想前往哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd3ac322343270effae4a28b1cf194d49f7b04339a24953ecd730ffaddf5b32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9320e22a422cb1d15a3931fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行……\r\n脑中全是多余的事情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb2c7589d259a63890723f7ac6408094eec1ae3f84a2b95b0577438f653bc97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ef522cc33082e7c4c26878",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在先全部忘掉……\r\n这样一来──",
      "source_fingerprint": "286195c756891266647395224df7bf6c32d910268ef4cd7bad67a834abc11300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147c4f07486697440fa140c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚步声太多了啊……\r\n没办法集中精神……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d94d9c124ec5e7edd7ab3f8ea93da4c1ac312b8169065d49aefcc8f4a72b1352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508c549dfc32c6a93668143f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………\r\n迟迟无法调整好呼吸呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "910646462cddb3b5757c865f9aff8da5ef91034061da14384462d0e4fe4465d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d551167d7f606e8c8a98d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95be0e5f954812ebb9df56804df2332c08cf3ce01e8bdeae85a217806ec453ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de033786ee21dd1776f06a2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36bb9300a755e2472a4d8862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e194e049d8a0793c1c034e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看看哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b061a690d0a42601b0bc6a7051eebca88c1dfb62fffbe5d2341d52aa14cc08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d92933d167800c8c687718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:749392447b8477de8514dfe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b5c20abae9548f6a768ce50f0c74ca578f87a9831911d1354fc0b65a452628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57740a807daef4787ad574f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf461312ffbc02ae447e770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好享受吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc05790692e30d621c27af98756ca812bad5b9d8c58dd06cf07253e68a5c5fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91aaba1a3033de9308c6bcf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的声援成为了我的力量哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c5863acdbfdf27b0ca00645f403d3ab8b5bc01d397ad364988957b9e80e5a01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722ecffcc3b7ea9699fcf543",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，我很开心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0a4ea91e3df210fdae1f7451aa4020398875046c1b8cd03f17cb3c61ab2857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be0e9af23d577ffdf58fb710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2080298e06a991155112edb4e342a764762244e7774e683ac1ea72828db6fbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:978d41ffd3155ff06d1c6ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随心所欲地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec011f6695a00dd2c1a5582f44f935ea5711c986d3f322b5142de7783661d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77b71ea4a1bb916df26a7efc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dee5939d2b38661086e5815f84384f0a3bea2688058a4deb13c2dc11bbe0ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7837e230ce96f4d19f7528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，我很开心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0a4ea91e3df210fdae1f7451aa4020398875046c1b8cd03f17cb3c61ab2857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbcef2274ee984d71f9e1d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望能跑出一场足以让观众\r\n无法忘怀的精彩竞赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b935085542c2f65d8c80bd7c235a5b7fd54c4aa8e0015f3de67efb87cc375c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a759959ee51627f933ec380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是为了在今天奔跑而诞生──\r\n这样想的话，也挺不错的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea65188ab4bf0dfa1d0113e29975941cd68e3874c580e59716e251bd81e53c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a026f392e4189d94ca44251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，我很开心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0a4ea91e3df210fdae1f7451aa4020398875046c1b8cd03f17cb3c61ab2857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8fd56f7abb05cf8dcd91f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やろう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10467fbdb0bf8f5488104ac41940c39299d0190cfcc380bae2f0997de7816f64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d84db513ba87f9d76e6d727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该可以再更拚尽全力才对……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1d860fea6f9732513fba9de7e193850732272af5fb0a1ffce8cde12bab2fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faf85383acc6364c92bed815",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是否成为下次比赛的经验了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f2398cf330c48f2cb8caf845c301a6479816921526afa3af04731be23cc0c54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28bacabcc2eeaa887f82da54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能再往前踏一步就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a5aa79754b586f643897a11459eeb4296c8a8dd0d9d9f9338207f5cf635027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a803c58bbd5dd6766dc2b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不小心迷失方向了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0f21d0599413ce68cd58d6240b30308b5a630e8da359c1031e232cebc0401d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cecab33ab8ed74cf0ef23d22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也能够明白吗？\r\n我现在……真的开心无比！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa708d1d2fa37568d0e54ce004f35e29d6a7698f603cef25fee34c7acbdc96b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcc7708364e7c1915793737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～这场比赛跑得真是舒畅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b897278c5f67d84bf0a9e329493967c0c9fb8895196519866edb46825b662fd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b34c34736bc8385b4620d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1bc8931ce94cb5b2de86270e03f2d4b9a446effa7ceaa56679c173e0781ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81113dc480ae434a6a0add0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这就是我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ccc16a97243c545c91497d4e3ca183d183e0f33f4b0613f83ddb841ebaeabee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4f0c68f5a5653eee644301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还不晓得\r\n会做出一本什么样的导览手册……\r\n呵呵，但总之我很期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d22a93c219a93bb1ce1f3fcf19929b295a22403bddc0cce760084a4164871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ee2f9489f951b83fb8600c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，新的世界要开始了呢。\r\n走吧，前往更远的地方。\r\n风在呼唤我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3641eea8aa956fb332fb50f5ced71a4fc6cedab89e26d64a3f1af4d1823f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed89ab96e5a410a80a8c577f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这双脚不会停下来……！因为、\r\n因为──我的内心是如此渴望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e73e50eea62e89e40fdf6d2398922833b10cf866de6170a8f25210f34b2c0967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a19d00ac2f0b137e8374c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这就去尽情享受啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4603866ffa20853111ece861df558a38f362adf5aaf794f65e87d250b6cbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df019b505c10f9f5e85e6756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旋律传进耳里了……\r\n呵呵，让我心情高昂起来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2501cc667b50feba9269c606a26d188507b31fd4091429c3cc33da4e85933f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d05d0337575796ae0887a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你愿意放我自由奔跑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bbbf804de7b0ca9266510a61eb210056cafd6f804a91e0bcda3ddf32708847e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964a806d9f6196988da4ea84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们之所以能够相遇，\r\n是因为你始终贯彻自我的缘故哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5539f64dcddf4faddfcff0ef292aff521f9788d2a7dce2788d64ec03e123026",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3a63b4688977aee1a2631c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天早上不用烦恼穿什么，\r\n真是轻松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29488d57822143f2b9bfbf720abcf1eb6a2150ce8b17af278a4428dc8eb52b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da5bf1115f3a1ff7ebeadea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算舞步稍微跳错，因为穿着相同的\r\n衣服而不容易被发现，真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df2e23a959c8a1b490df3f79e4d9922cb670ce5e020275058410c9ddd14368f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5d3a34b9302befe6bbeac20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服，\r\n代表着我就是「我」的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b599ec804b1fa317c6ae21fd6cab28f38f523ab61c91a31d79b72e24bc53fbb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b70627c1b804a0bd7075fdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有时候也会想穿\r\n自己喜欢的衣服去学校就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0630a6d31f1bf81c370c526b5469c92aca856de177b298d0fc8728fe085d5ffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303c6628d9516b67e9e49759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸好这套衣服的材质相当坚韧，\r\n即使用力刷洗也不会变形。",
      "source_fingerprint": "163202eb857128fde79f04b93f89bdce5105075c89bb38ce8ccd4476d8bdee8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0cb04f95cd302c0734badd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在雨中，\r\n这套决胜服也很显眼对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fcbe4693348fed06d8eedf33fa77fb1fa61179ec079f01ff9ac15e333bf0254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29144064fe3f3cbb564f6b66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我也喜欢这件呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e9a9c39cda5cdd1d833a604e87ce91c5e5fce79e77405095e8d256cd4768cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcda022736100fa0e9b0692e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多衣服的话，会很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2f081302c44e90264110e668971530d6e2c7e1fae4820e3ef2a578f9063872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27cba7c5c3a37cd9289b17ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽でいいよ。着やすいし、\r\n動きやすいし、なにより洗いやすい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2989739a6f1c6518467f13e3012232a50dfac261777f7479e0b7a111f5549b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f018327c704ac29f258a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこかに行きたくなっちゃうな。\r\n…ちょっと走ってきてもいい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c071fd43eaf8ca44e4a33ff6395dcc2083fd36d2d2a5156db0c1bb7a4f9cab3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:681a6fc44ad5dcad3d308671",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天早上不用烦恼穿什么，\r\n真是轻松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29488d57822143f2b9bfbf720abcf1eb6a2150ce8b17af278a4428dc8eb52b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77b1d12379ce1613b0bbaae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算舞步稍微跳错，因为穿着相同的\r\n衣服而不容易被发现，真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df2e23a959c8a1b490df3f79e4d9922cb670ce5e020275058410c9ddd14368f",
