      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸好这套衣服的材质相当坚韧，\r\n即使用力刷洗也不会变形。",
      "source_fingerprint": "163202eb857128fde79f04b93f89bdce5105075c89bb38ce8ccd4476d8bdee8e",
