      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d07e64e296ca7cf7117e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我也喜欢这件呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e9a9c39cda5cdd1d833a604e87ce91c5e5fce79e77405095e8d256cd4768cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b970fa9489d19cf7dffe2a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多衣服的话，会很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2f081302c44e90264110e668971530d6e2c7e1fae4820e3ef2a578f9063872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca490367e153962adb8768e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f91abeb437a4bd5caeaa449",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシと走りたい？\r\nいいよ。楽しいレースにしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1abec740bfc53988ebae9295fc4b7d4f79b8bc6e48e01770c097eae5ab3f97f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a57aa05d87f6cc8fbab3d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいね、キミの走りも。\r\nけど、アタシより\r\n自由に走れるかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32851fa22df6788ff670a0c95432d648be11f959db8281ff8a5f7e40a7ab5ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9057a91368c7c96a286c902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n我用我的步伐、你用你的步伐，\r\n今天也一起迈步向前吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f605885855934761044db0bbd6f1f79168664224550b1320aaae20cd0ddaa896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd3a3449e734efa09800d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是美好的早晨呢。\r\n天空宛如没有边际般辽阔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "344bb965ae118a5d80dd7ff1a41a149caa549b2dc3c8ab60f0bafe51d2b03e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8869229092b6bdfbaaa1b7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你待会要做什么呢？\r\n如果目的地相同的话，\r\n一起散步过去也挺不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1759315652639d65a6523e855b8ae1304d5358e158ceeb7ce5057a6ff0d5efa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
